[{"id":2580611487,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Z0QGf","state":"APPROVED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\n## Benchmark\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** Intel Core i9-13900K\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-5800 C30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 41)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nUsing an optimized editor build with LTO.\r\n\r\nStartup + shutdown times of the editor on an empty project:\r\n\r\n```\r\n❯ hyperfine -iw1 -m50 \"bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64 /tmp/5/project.godot --quit\" \"bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.master /tmp/5/project.godot --quit\"\r\nBenchmark 1: bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64 /tmp/5/project.godot --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      4.528 s ±  0.435 s    [User: 2.589 s, System: 0.712 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    3.770 s …  5.322 s    50 runs\r\n \r\nBenchmark 2: bin/godot.linuxbsd.editor.x86_64.master /tmp/5/project.godot --quit\r\n  Time (mean ± σ):      4.620 s ±  0.340 s    [User: 2.597 s, System: 0.693 s]\r\n  Range (min … max):    3.753 s …  4.825 s    50 runs\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis PR is on average 0.1s faster to startup and shut down the editor on an empty project.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102129#pullrequestreview-2580611487","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102129","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-01-29T10:32:43Z"},{"id":2580619578,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Z0SE6","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?u=af70f5d107e9c1447f296643d5a566dab53d25e8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","login":"AThousandShips","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102129#pullrequestreview-2580619578","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102129","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-01-29T10:38:36Z"},{"id":2580973654,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6Z1ohW","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","login":"Ivorforce","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/102129#pullrequestreview-2580973654","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/102129","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-01-29T13:03:31Z"},{"id":2594777736,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6aqSqI","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"6c82cf07376d693f3f97779cd3a820d8a5c1047b","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?u=2867ee7fcd920bc19b7d1cbf4b10264b9bbc9326&v=4","created_at":"